    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**UNDER OFFER**\n\nHorgan Properties are delighted to present this beautifully maintained 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached residence, occupying a prime corner site at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac within this established residential development. Situated on one of the largest sites in the estate and held in Folio KY57046F, the property enjoys an enviable position with no neighbouring properties beyond or to the rear. This exceptional setting provides a wonderful sense of privacy, openness and space, rarely found in residential developments. Ideally located just a 10-minute stroll from Listowel town centre, it offers easy access to a wide range of amenities, including shops, schools, cafés, restaurants, the Town Park and the Greenway. The nearby N69 bypass provides convenient links to Tralee and Limerick, while the renowned seaside resort of Ballybunion is just a 15-minute drive away.\n\nBuilt in 2006, the property extends to approximately 92 sq. metres of bright and inviting accommodation. A welcoming entrance hall, leads to the main ground-floor living areas. The spacious living room features a cast-iron fireplace with a multi-fuel stove, polished granite hearth and solid timber surround. Glazed double doors connect to the open-plan kitchen and dining area, making it ideal for both everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen is fitted with cream wall and base units, contrasting worktops and a tiled splashback, providing ample storage and preparation space. The dining area comfortably accommodates a family-sized table and is flooded with natural light. Sliding patio doors open directly onto the rear patio and garden, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living. A convenient understairs storage cupboard and guest WC further enhance the practicality of the ground floor. Upstairs, a bright landing is beautifully finished with solid timber flooring that continues throughout all three bedrooms. The master bedroom is positioned to the front of the property and enjoys the added benefit of a private ensuite shower room. The family bathroom is also located to the front, while a generous double bedroom and a comfortable single bedroom overlook the rear garden. A hot press on the landing provides additional storage. Features such as oil-fired central heating, double-glazed uPVC doors and windows, and a solid fuel stove in the living area ensure a comfortable C2 energy rating. There is excellent potential to achieve a B2 rating by means of available SEAI home energy upgrade grants. This property is connected to all mains services.\n\nOccupying one of the largest corner sites within the development, this impressive home enjoys an exceptional sense of space and privacy. A generous tarmac driveway provides ample off-street parking, while the expansive side and rear gardens offer plenty of outdoor space for children to play, scope for gardening or those wishing to extend the property in the future, subject to planning permission. Set on an east and west-facing site, it enjoys an abundance of natural light throughout the day. Beautifully presented throughout and ready for immediate occupation, this turnkey property combines generous accommodation, an attractive location within walking distance of Listowel town centre and outstanding outdoor space. It would be an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors alike. Early viewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through sole selling agents Horgan Properties on 068 24793.\n\nOutside \nParking for 2 vehicles to the front\nCorner property on extensive site \nNot overlooked to the rear and side\n\nServices \nMains services"
      },
