        "Content": "Entrance Hall (9.48ft x 5.30ft) Front aspect. Door leading into living room. Wood-effect flooring and solid wood stairs leading to upper floor. <br>Living Room (14.89ft x 13.44ft) Front aspect. Wood-effect flooring. Fireplace with wood surround and solid fuel stove. Glazed double doors leading to open-plan kitchen/living room. <br>Kitchen/Dining Room (13.98ft x 16.64ft) Rear aspect. Double glazed doors leading from living room. Open-plan. Porcelain floor tiles. Fitted kitchen units. Electric oven. Extractor. Sink. PVC sliding patio doors opening onto rear garden. <br>Inner Hallway (3.08ft x 4.02ft) Located off of kitcen/dining room. Leads to separate downstairs guest WC. Could be useful as a storage closet.<br>Downstairs WC (5.63ft x 2.83ft) Porcelain floor tiles. WC. Wash handbasin. <br>Landing (11.71ft x 6.23ft) Solid wood flooring. Access to attic space. <br>Master Bedroom (12.45ft x 10.08ft) Double room ensuite. Front aspect. Solid wood flooring. <br>En-suite (4.53ft x 7.10ft) Side aspect. Porcelain floor tiles. Tiled shower enclosure with Triton T90 SR electric shower. WC. Wash handbasin.<br>Bedroom 2 (12.99ft x 9.49ft) Double room. Rear aspect. Solid wood flooring. <br>Bedroom 3 (9.48ft x 6.80ft) Single room. Rear aspect. Solid wood flooring. <br>Bathroom (6.74ft x 6.15ft) Porcelain floor tiles. Tiled splashback and bath surround. Bath with overhead shower attachment. WC. Wsh handbasin. Velux window."
